# The Golod–Shafarevich series inequality

The coefficientwise inequality `(∑ aₙ tⁿ)(1 - d t + r t²) ≥ 1`.

Paper reference: Theorem 2.33 (step) of Dérickx–Gillibert–Keller–Pagano, *Golod–Shafarevich for arithmetic
surfaces*.  Formalization plan: `LEAN-PLAN.md`.
